{
 "schema": 1,
 "about": "Every test-build smoke a release has run since 0.1.61 (release073/074), with what triggers it. select-smokes.py picks core + changed-path entries for the release gate; the rest runs as the post-LIVE background tail on the same test build. Paths: S/ = apps/browser/Sources/Airc/, K/ = packages/AircKit/Sources/AircKit/. seconds = release074's active time per engine (without its fixed idle sleeps). want = release074's PASS floor. Debug files are mapped automatically from SnapshotRunner.swift's case lines. Debug/ files (test code, absent from the public build) put their checks at the head of the tail, not in the gate. Of a script's posted/real twins (same env) the gate runs the one with the higher want; the other runs in the tail.",
 "defaults": {
  "limit": 600,
  "overhead_seconds": 3,
  "idle_by_mode": {
   "bg": 0,
   "posted": 0,
   "gate": 0,
   "dgate": 0,
   "front": 6,
   "perf": 6,
   "fg": 6,
   "fp": 6,
   "real": 6,
   "tfg": 6,
   "pfg": 6
  }
 },
 "ignore_paths": [
  "docs/*",
  "apps/marketing/*",
  "assets/*",
  "tools/social/*",
  "*.md",
  "briefs/*",
  "apps/browser/Resources/WhatsNew.json",
  "apps/browser/Resources/WhatsNew/*",
  "scripts/release/whatsnew*",
  "infra/*",
  "engine/host/*",
  "engine/*.md",
  "apps/browser/Tests/*",
  "packages/*/Tests/*",
  "scripts/marketing-shots.sh",
  "S/Debug/Marketing*",
  "S/Debug/Social*",
  "LICENSE",
  "NOTICE",
  ".gitignore"
 ],
 "engine_paths": [
  "engine/core/*",
  "engine/patches/*",
  "engine/BUILD*",
  "engine/*.gn",
  "engine/*.gni",
  "CHROMIUM_VERSION",
  "S/Engine/ChromiumEngine*.swift",
  "S/Engine/WebKitEngine*.swift",
  "S/Engine/BrowserEngine.swift",
  "S/Engine/HybridEngine.swift"
 ],
 "broad_paths": [
  "K/Model.swift",
  "K/Database.swift",
  "packages/AircDesign/*",
  "S/App/AppDelegate.swift",
  "S/App/main.swift",
  "S/App/AppSettings.swift",
  "S/App/Commands.swift",
  "S/UI/*",
  "S/Browser/WindowController.swift",
  "scripts/build-app.sh",
  "apps/browser/Package.swift",
  "packages/*/Package.swift",
  "apps/browser/Info*.plist",
  "apps/browser/*.entitlements",
  "S/Debug/SnapshotRunner.swift#harness"
 ],
 "core_note": "Always at release time, both engines: windows (winclose), sidebar (sidebarpolish), Command Bar (cbfocus A), sign-in (signin posted). Launch/HTTP/Notes/Little Airc key/full screen/sharing/PiP/onboarding/redirects are the fast gate (fast-gate.json); update is the stage's BinaryDelta + post-LIVE update proof.",
